# Billing — Operator routes (UC-111, UC-137). LOCAL USE ONLY.
# In staging and production the backend is on internal ingress: use scripts/billing-operator.sh from
# the relay VM shell instead (docs/RUNBOOKS.md § Operator cases). Every route needs both keys.
#
# `operator` is your name (stored as the audit row's actor); `reason` is required (1-500 characters).
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. pnpm infra:up
#   2. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run dev
#   3. a tenant with a subscription (pnpm provision, or the seed)
#
# REST Client environment: select "local" in VS Code status bar

@baseUrl     = {{backendUrl}}
@internalKey = {{$dotenv INTERNAL_API_KEY}}
@platformKey = {{$dotenv PLATFORM_ADMIN_KEY}}
@tenantId    = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
# graceUntil: an instant YOU choose, at least 14 days after the tenant went past due and never
# earlier than a grace already set (ISO-8601 UTC).
@graceUntil  = 2030-01-01T00:00:00Z
# Tenants for the refusal cases below (each needs the state named in its comment).
@exemptTenantId           = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@paymentSuspendedTenantId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@notPastDueTenantId       = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@ownerTenantId            = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004

### Investigation list (read-only): newest first, 25 per page, optional status filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/tenants?status=ACTIVE&limit=25&offset=0
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
X-Platform-Admin-Key: {{platformKey}}

###

### Suspend for abuse / takedown (reason OPERATOR). 403 BILLING_EXEMPT_PROTECTED for an exempt tenant
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/tenants/{{tenantId}}/billing/suspend
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
X-Platform-Admin-Key: {{platformKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operator": "Your Name", "reason": "abuse report #42" }

###

### Lift an OPERATOR suspension. 409 BILLING_UNSUSPEND_NOT_ALLOWED for a payment-based one
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/tenants/{{tenantId}}/billing/unsuspend
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
X-Platform-Admin-Key: {{platformKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operator": "Your Name", "reason": "false positive" }

###

### Extend grace on a PAST_DUE tenant. 409 BILLING_GRACE_NOT_ALLOWED otherwise, or if it would shorten the 14 days
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/tenants/{{tenantId}}/billing/grace
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
X-Platform-Admin-Key: {{platformKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operator": "Your Name", "reason": "customer promised payment", "graceUntil": "{{graceUntil}}" }

###

### Set exempt (free access); { "exempt": false } clears it into a fresh 14-day trial
PUT {{baseUrl}}/internal/tenants/{{tenantId}}/billing/exempt
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
X-Platform-Admin-Key: {{platformKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operator": "Your Name", "reason": "partner account", "exempt": true }

###

### Refusal: suspend an EXEMPT tenant -> 403 BILLING_EXEMPT_PROTECTED (clear exempt first)
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/tenants/{{exemptTenantId}}/billing/suspend
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
X-Platform-Admin-Key: {{platformKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operator": "Your Name", "reason": "abuse report #42" }

###

### Refusal: unsuspend a payment-based suspension -> 409 BILLING_UNSUSPEND_NOT_ALLOWED
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/tenants/{{paymentSuspendedTenantId}}/billing/unsuspend
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
X-Platform-Admin-Key: {{platformKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operator": "Your Name", "reason": "customer asked" }

###

### Refusal: grace on a tenant that is not PAST_DUE -> 409 BILLING_GRACE_NOT_ALLOWED
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/tenants/{{notPastDueTenantId}}/billing/grace
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
X-Platform-Admin-Key: {{platformKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operator": "Your Name", "reason": "customer promised payment", "graceUntil": "{{graceUntil}}" }

###

### Refusal: clear exempt on Ikaro's own tenant -> 403 BILLING_EXEMPT_PROTECTED
PUT {{baseUrl}}/internal/tenants/{{ownerTenantId}}/billing/exempt
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
X-Platform-Admin-Key: {{platformKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operator": "Your Name", "reason": "mistake", "exempt": false }

###

### Refusal: a missing or blank reason / operator -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/tenants/{{tenantId}}/billing/suspend
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
X-Platform-Admin-Key: {{platformKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operator": "Your Name" }
